# Everything in data/ is an asset rather than source: collected map data (refetched
# by MapData.kt), the catalogue geometry and the Figma svg exports, the raw Figma
# response written by FigmaApi.file(). Hundreds of megabytes, and all of it
# reproducible. The bundled font and the template images stay, because the sketches
# fall back to them.
data/*
!data/fonts/
!data/images/

# Client material, references and renders, not source.
export/
pre-work/
inspiration/
# the IFC model and the licensed dinner music the show reads from
input/

